    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi kuye: Buyela ngendlela yakho uye enkangala yaseDamaseko; lapho usufikile khona ugcobe uHazayeli abe yinkosi yaseSiriya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.8.7+2KI.8.8+2KI.8.9+2KI.8.10+2KI.8.11+2KI.8.12+2KI.8.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kho 8:7–13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loJehu indodana kaNimshi umgcobe abe yinkosi yakoIsrayeli, loElisha indodana kaShafati waseAbeli‐Mehola umgcobe abe ngumprofethi esikhundleni sakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.9.1+2KI.9.2+2KI.9.3+2KI.9.4+2KI.9.5+2KI.9.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kho 9:1–6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ozakhuthwa ngumhedla kaHazayeli uzabulawa nguJehu, lozakhuthwa ngumhedla kaJehu abulawe nguElisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa ngizatshiya koIsrayeli abantu abazinkulungwane eziyisikhombisa, bonke abangazanga baguqe ngamadolo abo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", lemilomo yabo engazanga imange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.11.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Roma 11:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UElija wasesuka lapho, wafica uElisha indodana kaShafati elima ngenkabi ezazibotshelwe emajogweni alitshumi lambili, yena ekwezazingemuva. UElija wadlula eceleni kwakhe, waphosela ingubo yakhe phezu kwakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wasetshiya izinkabi, wagijimela kuElija wathi: Ake ngiyevalelisa ubaba lomama, besengikulandela. Yena wathi: Buyela, ngoba ngenzeni kuwe na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasebuyela, wathatha inkabi zakhe ezimbili, wazihlaba, wabasa ngamajogwe umlilo wokupheka inyama yazo, wayinika abantu, bayidla. Wasesuka elandela uElija, waba yinceku yakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
